                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true'>Metric Calculation</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run>1. Scope : </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#59a14f'>All Registered Users </run>
                    <run>based on comms (email/push/IAM) received by the user within the period/month and lifecycle is based on start of the month.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run>2. Uplift aggregation : </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7'>Sum of all campaign-level/canvas-level uplifts</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
